It seem that an older, BUGGY, termcap.uu was inadvertently included
in part 26 of the full re-distribution of NetHack on comp.sources.games.

Apart from its defective performance, the "mark" of the BUGGY termcap.uu
is its ls size: 25830.  The ls size should be 26176.

The moderator of comp.sources.games has been notified, and he will take
correcting actions.  For the time being, if you are using the 
re-destributed NetHack Pl9 code, be advised that the termcap.uu included
in that distribution will cause you trouble.  Wait until the fixed
version is posted on comp.sources.games, grab it from a friend, or pick it
from linc.cis.upenn.edu via ftp.  The file is located in pub/NH3.0 under
the name 'Other.termcap.uu' (rename it to 'termcap.uu').

For the Development Team,

-Izchak


